;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Creature:_Mage_Hand_.28creature.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Mage_Hand_(creature)\"> Creature: Mage Hand (creature) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-right: 7px; width: 160px; height: 160px; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: circle(60px); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Hand_(creature)\" title=\"Mage Hand (creature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Portrait_Mage_Hand_%28creature%29.png/120px-Portrait_Mage_Hand_%28creature%29.png.webp, /w/images/f/f8/Portrait_Mage_Hand_%28creature%29.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Portrait_Mage_Hand_%28creature%29.png/120px-Portrait_Mage_Hand_%28creature%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Portrait_Mage_Hand_%28creature%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"width: 160px; height: 160px; position: absolute\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Hand_(creature)\" tit